Third-party components
================================================================================

The GPL-3.0 licence of this project is required by its dependencies rather than
chosen in preference to a permissive licence. No permissively licensed chess
engine exists.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Stockfish — GPL-3.0-or-later
https://stockfishchess.org/
Copyright (C) The Stockfish developers

Used as the analysis engine. Invoked as a separate process (native) and loaded
as WebAssembly in the browser. Not bundled with this repository; installed
separately by the user.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
chessground — GPL-3.0-or-later
https://github.com/lichess-org/chessground
Copyright (C) Lichess

Board UI component. Its bundled stylesheets are used, including the "cburnett"
piece set — chess piece artwork originally by Colin M.L. Burnett, embedded as
SVG in those stylesheets and redistributed by Lichess under the package's
GPL-3.0-or-later licence.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
